  "ruleText": "Elec 101.01 Purpose. The rules of this title implement the statutory responsibilities of the New Hampshire electricians board created by RSA 319-C:4.\n\nSource. #10354, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13; ss by #10421, eff 9-25-13",
